[0m[32mI made the mistake of forgetting to drink coffee today after drinking a cup every morning for the past year. It did not go well...at all. I usually wake up and make a cup of instant coffee. The caffeine perks me up and gets me ready for the rest of the day. But on this particular day, I was in a rush to go to the bank to do some business before I went to work, and I ended up leaving the house without my daily cup. 
[0m[32m
[0m[32mAs soon as I got into my car and started driving out of the driveway, I realized my mistake, but I was already on the move, and it was too late for me to turn around and go back for my hot beverage. So I decided to just forget it and continue on with the task at hand. I mean, it won't be a problem without one day of drinking coffee, will it? As soon as I finished that thought, I became distracted by a clown dancing at the corner of the upcoming intersection. The clown was spinning an arrow-shaped sign as it danced, so I couldn't quite make out what the sign said, but there appeared to be some printed writing on it. I stopped at the intersection and attempted to get a better look at the sign...or so I thought. 
[0m[32m
[0m[32mInstead of stopping at the intersection, I pressed my foot onto the wrong pedal and ended up accelerating through the intersection and was broadsided by a car coming from my right. As I brushed the shattered glass from the windshield off me, I looked up and saw that the vehicle that struck me was a blue-and-white police car, now with its blue lights flashing. I had been struck by a police officer trying to get to an emergency down the road, and I was subsequently ticketed for failing to stop at the stop sign. All of this was because I forgot my morning routine of drinking my morning cup of coffee. <|im_end|>[0m
