[0m[32mApple has always been the tip of the spear with new technology. Today we get to show the world once again the limitless possibilities of the human mind. With so much data and control at our fingertips with devices like the iPhone, Macbook, or even Apple Watch, we need to push the envelope to develop the future. What does the future look like? The future looks like this: the iThink.
[0m[32m
[0m[32mThe iThink is a neural implant that can do everything your smart devices do . . . and more. What's more, it does it without the need to carry or wear a device on you. You simply need to think, "Hey Siri, call Mom," to place a call. No more holding a phone to your head. The voice is transmitted directly into signals your brain can interpret completely bypassing any need for an ear. 
[0m[32m
[0m[32mSimilarly, the iThink augments the way you see the world. Look at an item in a store window. The iThink will automatically search the web for comparisons and show you price matches in an augmented reality display. Do you need to get up in the middle of the night? The iThink will increase your vision in the dark allowing you to traverse your home without waking up the missus. 
[0m[32m
[0m[32mWith the iThink replacing or augmenting most of your important sensory functions, who can afford to live the life of a lesser human? That is why we set the price for this at a mere $9,000 with the iThink+ at $19,000 and the iThink+ Pro at $50,000.
[0m[32m
